  "kv21.1:1.12": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… ",
  "kv21.1:1.13": "pubbe akusalaṃ pacchā kusalaṃ katanti. ",
  "kv21.1:1.14": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… ",
  "kv21.1:1.15": "pubbe sāsavaṃ …pe… saññojaniyaṃ ganthaniyaṃ oghaniyaṃ yoganiyaṃ nīvaraṇiyaṃ parāmaṭṭhaṃ upādāniyaṃ …pe… saṅkilesikaṃ pacchā asaṅkilesikaṃ katanti. ",
  "kv21.1:1.16": "na hevaṃ vattabbe …pe… ",
  "kv21.1:2.1": "atthi koci tathāgatassa sāsanaṃ navaṃ karotīti. ",
  "kv21.1:2.2": "āmantā. ",
